note contract 5 abstract lines 145-149: the body must be EXACTLY `or shl ulong x 32 ulong x`; the
note commuted body is a different body, so the check is kept, but it holds for every x: exit 0,
note stdout deadbeefdeadbeef (exp/a5-swap.out).
om2
abstract dup32 ulong ops rotr xor
holds dup32 dup32
fn dup32mk x uint to dup32
ret seal dup32 or ulong x shl ulong x 32
end
fn main to int
d = dup32mk 0xdeadbeef
puth open d
ret 0
end
